msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Fixed sample size at which the probability of conclusive, misleading, and "
"inconclusive evidence is evaluated."
msgstr ""
"Feste Stichprobengröße, anhand derer die Wahrscheinlichkeit für "
"aussagekräftige, irreführende und unschlüssige Evidenz bewertet wird."

